          "Second Derivative Rate of Change": "Differentiates to $-16x^{-3} + 40(2x-3)^{-3}$ (B2), and evaluates at $x = 4$ to obtain $\\frac{7}{100}$ (or $0.07$) (B1)."
        },
        "criteria_source": "mark_scheme_structured"
